   "widgets_values": [
    "## LTX-2.3 GGUF - baseline T2V (RTX 3090)\n\nVerified against this machine's node registry.\n\n- **Model**: `UnetLoaderGGUF` -> Q4_0 (11.8 GB).\n- **Text encoder**: core `CLIPLoader` with type `ltxv`. The LTXV pack's\n  Gemma/AV loaders list from `models/checkpoints`, which is empty here,\n  so they cannot be configured on this install.\n- **Decode**: `working_dtype=bfloat16` needs the updated node pack\n  (commit `9eceeda`+). On an older pack pick `auto`.\n\n### Tuning for VRAM\nRaise `horizontal_tiles`/`vertical_tiles` or set `working_device=cpu`\nto keep the full-length output accumulator out of VRAM."
   ],
